    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A group of stray cats accidentally wanders into a mysterious bat cave while searching for food. Use your magic brush to draw houses, shields, circles, and other objects to protect the cats from bat attacks. Each wave of bats lasts up to 10 seconds before retreating.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable &amp; heartwarming art style</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freely draw objects with auto-generated physics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangers include bats, lava, spikes, and more!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background evolves from dark caves to a sunny forest as you progress</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A journey of creativity and protection!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple cute cat poses and actions</strong></p></li></ul>",
